<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide 1996 sales up 6.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide 1996 sales up 6.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					34,382    vs   32,189</p>
<p>     - gas					  24,763    vs   23,586</p>
<p>     - welding				     3,692    vs    3,707</p>
<p>     - engineering and construction	  1,832    vs    1,321</p>
<p>     - chemicals and other		     4,095    vs    3,575</p>
<p>NOTE - Air Liquide gave its 1996 sales in a statement.</p>
<p>It said they were up 6.8 percent over 1995 levels. At a constant structure and exchange rates, and excluding engineering and construction, they were up 3.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
